scene start {
  screen.curtain.show(color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), duration: 0ms),
  wait(180ms),
  text.float(
    "6月17日 星期三",
    x: 960,
    y: 540,
    font_size: 38,
    color: rgba(1, 1, 1, 1),
    fade_in: 300ms,
    hold: 2000ms,
    fade_out: 300ms,
    blocking: true
  ),
  text.float(
    "学校排练室",
    x: 960,
    y: 540,
    font_size: 38,
    color: rgba(1, 1, 1, 1),
    fade_in: 300ms,
    hold: 2000ms,
    fade_out: 300ms,
    blocking: true
  ),
  camera.reset(all),
  scene.parallax.stop(),
  camera.reset(all, blocking: false),
  hide(scene_layer_*, blocking: false),
  particle.layers.clear(),
  background(none, blocking: false),
  sprite(
    scene_layer_0002,
    asset_00002,
    position: left,
    layout: scene(fit: cover, x: 960, y: 540),
    z: 0,
    blend: alpha,
    blocking: false
  ),
  camera.bind(scene_layer_0002, distance: 1),
  camera.reset(all, easing: ease_in_out),
  camera.move(
    all,
    scale_x: 1.15,
    scale_y: 1.15,
    color_saturation: 0.84,
    color_temperature: -0.02,
    mirror_shatter_center_x: 0.5,
    mirror_shatter_center_y: 0.5,
    mirror_shatter_intensity: 0,
    mirror_shatter_seed: 0,
    mirror_shatter_spread: 1,
    speed_lines_angle: 0,
    speed_lines_center_x: 0.5,
    speed_lines_center_y: 0.5,
    speed_lines_density: 0.55,
    speed_lines_intensity: 0,
    speed_lines_radial: true,
    speed_lines_region_ellipse: false,
    speed_lines_region_feather: 1,
    speed_lines_region_height: 1,
    speed_lines_region_width: 1,
    speed_lines_region_x: 0.5,
    speed_lines_region_y: 0.5,
    speed_lines_speed: 0,
    vignette_intensity: 0.1,
    color_tone: none,
    tween: [scale_x, scale_y, vignette_intensity, color_saturation, color_temperature],
    duration: 2800ms,
    easing: ease_in_out,
    blocking: false
  ),
  se(asset_00076, id: object_0013, loop: true, volume: 0.28, fade: 450ms),
  screen.curtain.hide(color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), duration: 720ms),
  "一般而言，我是那个最后离开排练室的人……",
  "下周二就要演出了，虽然并不是什么很难的曲子",
  "但终归还是有点不安的成分",
  text.box(visible: false, auto: true),
  wait(200ms),
  se(asset_00077, id: object_0011, volume: 0.21, fade: 0ms),
  "这里唯一的麦克风现在发出接触不良的电流声",
  "让人十分不适",
  "[wait=1000]我走近那个嗡嗡叫的家伙",
  "可能只是当时插线的时候没卡紧",
  text.box(visible: false, auto: true),
  wait(1000ms),
  "实际上看起来应该是线的接口坏了",
  "不管了，已经累了",
  "关掉电源时序器，看着效果器、调音台依次熄灭",
  se.stop(object_0013, fade: 120ms),
  "然后是关灯",
  text.box(visible: false, auto: true),
  camera.reset(all),
  screen.curtain.show(color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), duration: 260ms),
  scene.parallax.stop(),
  particle.layers.clear(),
  background(none, transition: fade(200ms), blocking: false),
  hide(scene_layer_*, transition: fade(200ms), blocking: false),
  wait(2000ms),
  camera.reset(all),
  scene.parallax.stop(),
  camera.reset(all, blocking: false),
  hide(scene_layer_*, blocking: false),
  particle.layers.clear(),
  background(none, blocking: false),
  sprite(
    scene_layer_0003,
    asset_00003,
    position: left,
    layout: scene(fit: cover, x: 960, y: 540),
    z: 0,
    blend: alpha,
    blocking: false
  ),
  camera.bind(scene_layer_0003, distance: 1),
  camera.move(
    all,
    scale_x: 1.025,
    scale_y: 1.025,
    color_saturation: 0.92,
    color_temperature: 0.08,
    mirror_shatter_center_x: 0.5,
    mirror_shatter_center_y: 0.5,
    mirror_shatter_intensity: 0,
    mirror_shatter_seed: 0,
    mirror_shatter_spread: 1,
    speed_lines_angle: 0,
    speed_lines_center_x: 0.5,
    speed_lines_center_y: 0.5,
    speed_lines_density: 0.55,
    speed_lines_intensity: 0,
    speed_lines_radial: true,
    speed_lines_region_ellipse: false,
    speed_lines_region_feather: 1,
    speed_lines_region_height: 1,
    speed_lines_region_width: 1,
    speed_lines_region_x: 0.5,
    speed_lines_region_y: 0.5,
    speed_lines_speed: 0,
    vignette_intensity: 0,
    color_tone: none,
    tween: [scale_x, scale_y, vignette_intensity, color_saturation, color_temperature],
    duration: 700ms,
    easing: ease_in_out,
    blocking: false
  ),
  se(asset_00082, id: object_0026, loop: true, volume: 0.67, fade: 450ms),
  screen.curtain.hide(color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), duration: 620ms),
  gallery.unlock(bgm, asset_00052, name: "bridge"),
  bgm(asset_00052, volume: 0.15, fade: 1000ms),
  "在我家的旁边有一座跨海大桥",
  "如果是平时我不会选择步行通过",
  "而一般是坐公交",
  "但是此刻的大桥已被镀上了一层金色的弧光",
  "好久没有遇到这样漂亮的晴空了",
  "即使太阳快要落山，也值得陪伴它多走一段路",
  text.box(visible: false, auto: true),
  wait(1000ms),
  "似乎仍有些余温的\n桥边的石板路，发出对脚步的嘎吱抗议",
  "只是一个人都没有",
  "只有车辆来往穿行",
  text.box(visible: false, auto: true),
  wait(1000ms),
  "于桥中央驻足",
  "似乎小的时候常和她来这里玩呢",
  "……",
  "虽然已经过去很久了",
  "桥的正中央，有着一个突出的平台",
  "我向那边侧目，似乎看到了几年前有两个孩子在这里留下的影子",
  "除了影子以外，还有一个关于以后的约定",
  "她还记得吗",
  "应该忘了吧。",
  "我整理了一下路上吹得有点掉的发带",
  "海风将衣物贴近身体\n从此时开始晃动的口袋里拿出手机",
  text.box(visible: false, auto: true),
  wait(2000ms),
  "「话筒那根线有点坏了 \n[wait=500]刚刚走的时候看了一下 ",
  "[wait=1000]应该是头短路了」",
  "我边走边用功能机发着这样的短信",
  "只是有点糟糕的是我并没有智能手机，[wait=500]所以也不能网购",
  "所以得拜托弹吉他的家伙帮我买一根",
  "「现在买一根新的还来得及」",
  "我并不会什么乐器，因此负责唱歌",
  "一直以来只有我用得到话筒，整个排练室也因此只有一条话筒线",
  "「你能帮我买一根吗」",
  "说到这个人",
  "我还蛮喜欢她的",
  text.retract(source: "我还蛮喜欢她的", keep: "我"),
  "...",
  "我觉得这个人不错",
  "[wait=500]短信发出去后产生了一种复杂的心情",
  text.box(visible: false, auto: true),
  wait(2000ms),
  "说起来所谓的演出其实只是个快闪类型的，[wait=500]校园活动性质的表演",
  "被老师安排在下午放学之后，也没有在校外的那种那么自由",
  "这种临时的活动，应该也没有人认真看吧——",
  "不过我不算是擅长糊弄的人",
  "[wait=1000]不管怎么样我会尽可能将它做好",
  text.box(visible: false, auto: true),
  wait(3000ms),
  "太阳正步入海平面",
  "此刻十分安静，车流稀疏\n只有海风吹拂的短暂触动",
  text.box(visible: false, auto: true),
  se.stop(object_0026, fade: 350ms),
  bgm(none, volume: 0, fade: 0ms),
  camera.reset(all),
  scene.parallax.stop(),
  particle.layers.clear(),
  background(none, transition: fade(200ms), blocking: false),
  hide(scene_layer_*, transition: fade(200ms), blocking: false),
  wait(200ms),
  screen.curtain.show(color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), duration: 320ms),
  camera.reset(all),
  goto(scene_0001)
}
